<https://docs.ogc.org/DRAFTS/20-044.html> rdfs:label "OGC API - Processes - Part 2: Deploy, Replace, Undeploy" .

<https://geolabs.github.io/ogcapi-processes-standard-as-bblocks/> a skos:ConceptScheme,
        dcat:Catalog,
        bblocks:BBlocksRegister ;
    rdfs:label "Building Blocks - OGC API - Processes (Standard as Building Blocks)" ;
    dct:abstract """OGC API — Processes, authored as Building Blocks. This is a proof-of-concept demonstrating the
"OGC Standards as BBs" methodology, where the standards document is generated from a set of
Building Blocks rather than from AsciiDoc source. Covers Part 1: Core and Part 2: Deploy,
Replace, Undeploy (the latter still a DRAFT standard, not yet adopted).
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:description """This repository contains the Building Blocks for OGC API — Processes Part 1: Core (OGC 18-062r3)
and OGC API — Processes Part 2: Deploy, Replace, Undeploy (OGC 20-044, **DRAFT**, not yet
adopted). It demonstrates the [OGC Standards as BBs](https://github.com/opengeospatial/ogcapi-processes/blob/master/docs/ogc-standards-as-bblocks.md)
proposal, where normative requirements, conformance tests, schemas, and prose are all co-located
in a Building Block, and the standards document is generated from the BB set.

New BB types introduced: `requirements-class`, `clause`, `terms`, `references`.
New `bblock.json` fields: `clause-index`, `normative`, `standardization-target`.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:modified "2026-11-09T13:02:41.984878"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    owl:imports <https://geolabs.github.io/bblock-ogcapi-processes-part2/build/register.json>,
        <https://geolabs.github.io/bblocks-ogcapi-processes/build/register.json>,
        <https://opengeospatial.github.io/bblocks/register.json> ;
    skos:hasTopConcept <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part1.clauses.conventions>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part1.clauses.references>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part1.clauses.scope>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part1.clauses.terms>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part1.requirements.core>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part1.requirements.json>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.annexes.ats>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.annexes.bibliography>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.annexes.revisionHistory>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.clauses.conformance>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.clauses.conventions>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.clauses.mediaTypes>,
        <bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.clauses.openapi>,
